title: canonical versioned message JSON v1 — minimal slice (current fields + delivery.state); defer trust/verified fields
---
Define ONE versioned wire schema so send / monitor / poll --json share a shape. v1 ships ONLY the fields emitted today plus delivery.state (queued/accepted/delivered). DEFER from.identity_pk / verified / trust_tier / priority until the identity-attestation and trust work land — adding them prematurely forces rework. Carry schema_version from day one so v2 is non-breaking. This is the dependency hub for the unified relay-aware monitor (B089) and any future harness unification. Decided: trusted-swarm-first, so keep v1 lean.